          "requirement_id": "TFQM-CKM-REVIEW-DFM-CKM-PHYSICS-FENCE-3"
        },
        {
          "requirement": "Normalize relative to row0/column0 using all four cross-ratio factors. Gauge action divides by the admitted column gauge. Return Outcome from aggregate operations and retain the raw-success evaluated legacy interfaces. Typed resource refusal is distinct from a classification result.",
